{"product_id":"juul2-blackcurrant-tobacco-pods","title":"JUUL2 Blackcurrant Tobacco Pods (2 Pods)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlackcurrant Tobacco JUUL2 pods feature mellow tobacco flavour with a twist of fresh blackcurrant to provide a smoky, yet fruity vape.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJUUL2 pods are only to be used with a JUUL2 Device. The JUUL2 Device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods manufactured by Juul Labs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's In The Box?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x JUUL2 pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVirginia Tobacco flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 JUUL2 pod contains: ~1.2 mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine concentration: ~18 mg\/mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal nicotine content: ~21.6 mg\/JUUL2 pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/juul-kenya\"\u003eJUUL2 pods\u003c\/a\u003e contain their uniquely satisfying e-liquid.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e18 mg\/ml nicotine strength. Each pack contains 2 pods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur e-liquid contains a proprietary formulation which includes Vegetable glycerin, Propylene glycol, Water, Nicotine, Benzoic acid, flavourings. You should not use this product if you are allergic to nicotine or to any other ingredient that it contains. See JUUL2 pods packaging for additional ingredient and safety information. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652483129399,"sku":"JL2 Blackcurrant Tobacco Pods","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul2-blackcurrant-tobacco.jpg?v=1746632348","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul2-blackcurrant-tobacco-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




